      ],
      "facts": [
        "Golem reports over 34 million systems are still vulnerable to PHP2Shell, about 82% unpatched.",
        "Germany's Federal Digital Ministry rates the incident as critical; state secretary Markus Richter says it's checking whether data leaked.",
